# credentials -- never commit
api-key*.json
# One person's standing BlazeMeter fixtures -- location, agent, test, virtual
# service ids. Not secret, but not a property of this project either: they name
# somebody's account, and a committed copy is an id everyone else's run would
# point at. CLAUDE.md says what a session does when this is absent.
testbed.local.*
# ...except the placeholder. Exact path, so a real key dropped next to it
# (examples/api-key.json) is still ignored.
!examples/api-key.example.json
*.env
kubeconfig*.yaml
kubeconfig*.yml
# Working notes and ticket drafts. Nothing here is meant to be committed, and
# an unignored scratch directory is one `git add -A` away from being.
.scratch/

